```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as 👤 Player A
    participant B as 👤 Player B
    participant C as 📋 LPBattleVault Contract
    participant P as 📊 Chainlink Price Feeds
    participant U as 🦄 Uniswap V3 Position Manager
    participant R as 🔧 Resolver (Anyone)

    Note over A,R: 🎮 LP Battle Vault - Technical Flow

    %% Phase 1: Create Battle
    rect rgb(230, 244, 255)
        Note over A,C: Phase 1: Create Battle
        A->>U: ownerOf(tokenId) - Verify ownership
        U-->>A: ✅ Owner confirmed
        A->>U: approve(battleContract, tokenId)
        A->>C: createBattle(tokenId, duration)
        C->>P: Check price feeds for USD valuation
        P-->>C: ✅ Fresh prices returned
        C->>U: safeTransferFrom(playerA, contract, tokenId)
        C-->>A: ✅ Battle created (battleId: 1)
        Note over C: Battle Status: "queued"
    end

    %% Phase 2: Join Battle
    rect rgb(240, 248, 235)
        Note over B,C: Phase 2: Join Battle
        B->>C: canJoinBattle(battleId, tokenId)
        C->>P: Check price feeds for both tokens
        P-->>C: ✅ Fresh prices returned
        C->>C: Calculate USD values & check ±5% tolerance
        C-->>B: ✅ Can join battle
        B->>U: approve(battleContract, tokenId)
        B->>C: joinBattle(battleId, tokenId)
        C->>U: safeTransferFrom(playerB, contract, tokenId)
        C-->>B: ✅ Battle joined
        Note over C: Battle Status: "onGoing"<br/>Timer: Started
    end

    %% Phase 3: Battle Period
    rect rgb(255, 248, 225)
        Note over A,R: Phase 3: Battle Period (Automatic)
        loop During Battle Duration
            Note over C: 📊 Real-time Tracking
            C->>U: positions(tokenId) - Get position data
            C->>C: Check if positions are "in range"
            C->>C: Calculate accumulated fees
            Note over C: Update current leader
        end
        Note over C: ⏰ Time expires<br/>Status: "readyToResolve"
    end

    %% Phase 4: Resolution
    rect rgb(248, 231, 255)
        Note over R,C: Phase 4: Battle Resolution
        R->>C: resolveBattle(battleId)
        C->>C: Verify time has expired
        C->>U: Get final position data for both tokens
        C->>C: Determine winner based on:<br/>1. In-range status<br/>2. Fee comparison<br/>3. Tie-breaking rules
        
        alt Both In Range
            C->>C: Compare fees → Higher fees wins
        else Only One In Range
            C->>C: In-range player wins
        else Both Out of Range
            C->>C: Random selection
        end

        C->>U: collect() fees from both positions
        C->>C: Calculate resolver reward (1%)
        C->>C: Distribute remaining fees to winner
        C->>U: safeTransferFrom() - Return NFTs to owners
        C-->>R: ✅ Battle resolved
        Note over C: Battle Status: "ended"<br/>Winner: Determined
    end

    %% Final State
    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over A,R: 🎉 Battle Complete
        Note over A: Receives NFT back
        Note over B: Receives NFT back
        Note over C: Winner receives all fees<br/>Resolver receives 1% reward
    end
```